  {
   "title": "Soho House - 2019",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>In 2019, LAGB expanded to include a kick-off party at the new Soho Warehouse in the Arts District hosted by <strong>Zachary Drucker</strong>. We featured <strong>DJ Ana Calderon</strong> and <strong>Chris Holmes</strong>, comedy from <strong>Nina Tarr</strong>, <strong>Sarah Squirm</strong>, <strong>Jak Knight,</strong> and <strong>Brandon Wardell</strong>, with live performances from <strong>Moses Sumney</strong>, <strong>Devendra Banhart</strong>, <strong>Machinedrum,</strong> and <strong>Nosaj Thing</strong>. The evening also included speakers from both My Friend’s Place and Downtown Women’s Center.</p>"
    },
