     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The live events were complemented by an online auction featuring coveted items donated from celebrities and beloved local brands, including Billie Eilish, LA Dodgers, Shepard Fairey &amp; OBEY, Diplo, Seth Rogen &amp; Evan Goldberg, Poppy, Grumpy Cat, Lil Miquela, Tenacious D, Eric Andre, SIMONE, Ableton, The Ace Hotel, Mr. Pickles, and many more.</p>"
