  {
   "title": "LIVESTREAM PIVOT - 2020",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Due to COVID restrictions in 2020, we transformed the annual party into a 24-Hour Global Virtual Telethon that brought together LA talent in new way. Inside Death Metal Santa’s Castle, our live hosts led us through a full day of DJ sets, live performances, surprise special guests, exclusive giveaways, and a Twitch charity sweepstakes. 100% of all donations went to our charity partners <strong>SchoolHouse Connection</strong>, <strong>Downtown Women’s Center,</strong> and <strong>My Friend’s Place</strong>.</p>"
    },
