  {
   "title": "Virtual Talent - 2020",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>We curated over 60 artists, musicians, and DJs for both pre-recorded segments and live in-house performances, including <strong>A-Trak</strong>, <strong>Baauer &amp; Holly, Madeon</strong>, <strong>Matt Berninger of The National</strong>, <strong>Open Mike Eagle</strong>, <strong>Pussy Riot</strong>, <strong>Tim Heidecker &amp; Weyes Blood</strong>, <strong>Tom Morello</strong> of Rage Against The Machine, and more.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Our global telethon also featured an eclectic showcase of special holiday performances, including puppets, magic tricks, and more from <strong>The Bob Baker Marionette Theater</strong>, <strong>Eric Andre</strong>, <strong>Chad Smith</strong> of Red Hot Chili Peppers, <strong>Duff McKagan</strong> of Guns N’ Roses, <strong>Sarah Squirm,</strong> and more.</p>"
