  {
   "title": "Original content - 2020",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Our animated cast of characters, including Death Metal Santa, the hijinks-filled McCreeper, a pair of miserable elves and more, came to life in our custom built dark North Pole. 10 pre-made segments were rolled out throughout the livestream, adding a narrative arc to the event. We also created a fleet of videos featuring our characters that were revealed in the weeks leading up to the event.</p>"
    },
