  {
   "title": "Auction & Sweepstakes - 2020",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>In lieu of an in-person auction, we hosted a digital charity sweepstakes on the fundraising platform Fandiem that offered fans the ability to donate to win a slew of curated prizes from big-name talent and the best of LA brands. From a custom leather Zedd x BMW jacket, to a signed Pearl Jam concert poster, a curated merch package from Ariana Grande, a chance to play FIFA19 vs. Quinn XCII, and many more there was something exciting for everyone.</p>"
    },
