  {
   "title": "LA Gives Back: The Return - 2023",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>After a brief hiatus, IHC re-launched LA Gives Back in partnership with promoters BROWNIES AND LEMONADE, SHREK RAVE, HEAV3N, ELECTRIC FEELS, CLUB 90S, HACK THE PLANET and RESTLESS NITES. This was a special year with a secret lineup, a confirmed mega headliner, and some of LA’s best promoters curating the stage. We raised over $50k with 100% of the proceeds donated to charity!</p>"
    },
