   "title": "Poster Gallery",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>LA Gives Back has a legacy of iconic posters, each with art from Luke McGarry. Featuring the LAGB mascot Death Metal Santa in poses inspired by movie sequels, the images showcase the dynamics of the event powerfully. Additional posters have also been created by Matthew Goldmand and IHC founder, Franki Chan.</p>"
